{"id":"vod_zy360_67344","vodId":"67344","provider":"zy360","providerName":"360资源","type":2,"name":"花丸幼稚园","name_cn":"花丸幼稚园","date":"2010-01-01","year":"2010","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全12集","images":{"common":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20241101-1/b94f4c647ad95ea32a86cf362e306d10.jpg"},"summary":"目前，超级宅男土田直纯（日野聪配音）在一所名叫花丸的幼稚园中担任老师的职务，在可爱的小朋友们的围绕下，每天都过着充满欢笑的生活。在个性单纯直率的杏（真堂圭配音）的眼中，土田老师是世界上最最优秀的男人，她无视巨大的年龄差距，发誓漫长的余生，非他不嫁。在好友小梅（樱井真子配音）和柊（高垣彩阳配音）的帮助下，杏锲而不舍的一次又一次向土田老师发动着恋爱进攻。可是，土田早就有了心上人——隔壁班的老师山本菜菜子（叶月絵理乃配音）。不过，个性有些迟钝和天然呆的山本似乎对土田的心意没有半分察觉。在花丸幼稚园里，一出出轻松愉快的恋爱喜剧每一天都在上演着。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-11-01 16:24:12","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"360zy","episodes":[{"name":"第01话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241031/I0WwfeIy/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241031/T2RwDhyl/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241031/L43JDPHN/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241031/QMfg0nYZ/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241031/K9szc7YB/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241031/AXysiVGl/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241031/gXMFRQzz/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241031/RFUPoDeT/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241031/xgITqBjf/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241031/WowIudph/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241031/rZtlepZH/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241031/lsEUUoDT/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:36:35.420Z"}